# Agent tooling. It checks git worktrees out under .claude/worktrees/, which are
# copies of this repo and must never be committed into it. The commands under
# .claude/commands/ are the exception: they are project procedure, they are
# short, and ignoring them means they live in one container and nowhere else.
.claude/*
!.claude/commands/

# Material auxiliar de trabajo (insumo, no contenido publicable)
_material/

# Notas de trabajo. Nunca se commitea: el repo es público y este archivo cita
# cifras del cliente que están deliberadamente difuminadas en las capturas.
PREGUNTAS.md

# Python bytecode — scripts/reindex_vectors.py imports scripts/build_corpus.py
__pycache__/
